          "block_content": "解: ∵ AB∥CD\n∴ △AOB ∽ △COD\n即  $ \\frac{AO}{CO} = \\frac{AB}{CD} $ ∵ AB = 1, CD = 2, AC = 6\n∴  $ \\frac{AO}{CO} = \\frac{1}{2} $ ⇒ CO = 2AO\n又∵ AC = AO + CO = 3AO ⇒ BAO = 6, AO = 2\n又∵  $ \\frac{S_{\\triangle AOB}}{S_{\\triangle COD}} = \\left(\\frac{AB}{CD}\\right)^2 = \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{1}{S_{\\triangle COD}} $\n∴ S_{\\triangle COD} = 4\n∴ S_{\\triangle AOB} 与 S_{\\triangle BOC} (不同底, 同高)\n且底之比为 OA : OC = 1 : 2\n∴ S_{\\triangle AOB} : S_{\\triangle BOC} = 1 : 2 ∵ S_{\\triangle AOB} = 1\n∴ S_{\\triangle BOC} = 2. 同无理 : S_{\\triangle AOD} 与 S_{\\triangle COD} (不同底, 同高)\n且底之比为 OA : OC = 1 : 2 ∴ S_{\\triangle AOD} : S_{\\triangle COD} = 1 : 2",
